@startuml app-config-persistence
allowmixing
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam defaultFontSize 11
skinparam arrowThickness 1.5

title 配置持久化协作

legend right
  |= 模块 |= 颜色 |= 说明 |
  | :app | <#E3F2FD> | 应用层 |
  | :ime-ui | <#E8F5E9> | UI 层 |
  | :ime-engine | <#FFF3E0> | 引擎层 |
  | 设置变更 | <#FFF9C4> | 设置变更路径 |
  | 日志配置 | <#F3E5F5> | 日志配置路径 |
endlegend

' ===== :ime-engine =====
package ":ime-engine" #FFF3E0 {
  class ImeConfig <<(D,#FFF3E0)>> {
    + engine: EngineConfig
    + ui: UiConfig
    + runtimeOverrides: Set<ConfigField>
  }
  class ImeEngine <<(C,#FFF3E0)>> {
    + updateConfig(block)
    + state: StateFlow<ImeState>
  }
  note right of ImeConfig
    **运行时优先原则**
    runtimeOverrides 记录被运行时临时修改的字段
    持久化同步时跳过这些字段
    重启后根据持久化配置重新初始化
  end note
}

' ===== :ime-ui =====
package ":ime-ui" #E8F5E9 {
  class KeyboardViewModel <<(C,#E8F5E9)>> {
    + state: StateFlow<ImeState>
    + config: ImeConfig
    + updateConfig(transform)
    + setLayoutMode(mode)
  }
  class KeyboardHost <<(C,#E8F5E9)>> {
    订阅 viewModel.state
    订阅 viewModel.layoutMode
  }
  note right of KeyboardViewModel
    **updateConfig() 仅修改运行时**
    不做持久化
    委托 engine.updateConfig()
    UI 通过 ImeState.config 自动同步
  end note
}

' ===== :app =====
package ":app" #E3F2FD {
  class ConfigDataStore <<(C,#E3F2FD)>> {
    - context: Context
    + config: Flow<ImeConfig>
    + updateConfig(transform)
    --
    持久化 EngineConfig:
      keyboardType, handMode, features,
      candidatePredictionEnabled, singleLineInput
    持久化 UiConfig:
      themeType, xPadEnabled, audioFeedback,
      hapticFeedback, keyAnimation, keyPopupTips,
      gestureSlippingTrail, clipPopupTips,
      logLevel, logStoragePath, ...
  }
  class IMEService <<(C,#E3F2FD)>> {
    + onCreate()
    + onCreateInputView(): View
  }
  class SettingsScreen <<(C,#E3F2FD)>> {
    设置页面
  }
  class QuickSettingsPopup <<(C,#E3F2FD)>> {
    键盘内快捷设置
  }
  class ImeLog <<(O,#E3F2FD)>> {
    + updateLevel(newLevel)
  }
  class LogStorage <<(C,#E3F2FD)>> {
    + updateDir(logDir)
  }
}

' ===== 配置变更双路径 =====

rectangle "设置页面变更\n(持久化 + 运行时)" #FFF9C4 {
  SettingsScreen --> ConfigDataStore : updateConfig\n(持久化到 DataStore)
  SettingsScreen --> KeyboardViewModel : updateConfig\n(修改运行时配置)
}

rectangle "快捷设置变更\n(仅运行时)" #E8F5E9 {
  QuickSettingsPopup --> KeyboardViewModel : updateConfig\n(仅修改运行时)
}

note right of QuickSettingsPopup
  通过 QuickSettingsPopup 等键盘 UI
  进行的临时修改只调用
  viewModel.updateConfig()
  不写入 DataStore
end note

' ===== 协作关系 =====
IMEService --> ImeEngine : 创建\nImeEngine.create(config)
IMEService --> KeyboardViewModel : Factory(engine)
IMEService --> ConfigDataStore : 读取初始配置

KeyboardViewModel --> ImeEngine : updateConfig()
ImeEngine --> ImeConfig : 运行时修改
ImeEngine --> ImeState : state.config 自动同步

ConfigDataStore --> ImeConfig : 读取恢复
KeyboardHost --> KeyboardViewModel : collectAsState()

' ===== 日志配置特殊路径 =====
rectangle "日志等级变更\n(持久化 + 运行时)" #F3E5F5 {
  ConfigDataStore --> ImeLog : updateLevel(newLevel)
}

rectangle "日志路径变更\n(持久化 + 运行时)" #F3E5F5 {
  ConfigDataStore --> LogStorage : updateDir(newDir)
}

' ===== 流程说明 =====
note bottom
  **配置变更双路径**

  1. 设置页面 → 同时执行:
     - ConfigDataStore.updateConfig() (持久化)
     - viewModel.updateConfig() (运行时，触发 UI 更新)

  2. 快捷设置 → 仅执行:
     - viewModel.updateConfig() (运行时)
     - 不写入 DataStore

  3. 运行时优先原则:
     - 运行时修改始终优先于持久化配置
     - runtimeOverrides 记录临时修改字段
     - 重启后由 ConfigDataStore 从 DataStore 恢复

  4. 日志配置特殊:
     - logLevel 变更 → ImeLog.updateLevel() (立即生效)
     - logStoragePath 变更 → LogStorage.updateDir() (切换目录)
end note

@enduml
